00:26:51.310 --> 00:26:52.070
OK?

00:26:52.070 --> 00:26:56.060
So let's see what happened.

00:26:56.060 --> 00:27:01.070
And indeed, you see that
the non-MTLS traffic

00:27:01.070 --> 00:27:02.930
