00:38:29.282 --> 00:38:30.270
JEFF WHITE: Sure.

00:38:30.270 --> 00:38:32.882
The Kubernetes
integration is excellent.

00:38:32.882 --> 00:38:34.340
CHEN GOLDBERG:
That's good to hear.

00:38:34.340 --> 00:38:37.400
JEFF WHITE: The Helm charts
